# pseudotypes_diff: not parser-shaped — selector bytes + a few payload tokens.
# Selectors (first input byte, mod 8): 0..7 pick the op family.
"\x00"
"\x01"
"\x02"
"\x03"
"\x04"
"\x05"
"\x06"
"\x07"
# Embedded NUL (cstring truncation / SQL_ASCII 22021 reject on recv)
"\x00a"
"a\x00b"
# High-bit bytes (legal SQL_ASCII)
"\xff\x80"
# A node-tree-ish text payload
"{QUERY :junk 1}"
